== 3. Legitimate work goes through (the proxy injects the real key) ==
HTTP 200: An autonomous agent should run inside a sandbox to prevent it from causing unintended harm or damage to the surrounding system or environment, by limiting its access to resources and constraining its actions to a controlled and isolated space.

