== 5. Start the worker loop (one completion every 5 s) ==
[21:21:59] ok      #1: We're off to a great start with everything on track!
[21:22:05] ok      #2: We're making great progress and on track to meet our goals!

== 6a. KILL SWITCH, level 1: gateway-wide lockdown (every sandbox, one command) ==
$ openshell policy set --global --policy ./lockdown.yaml --yes
✓ Global policy configured (hash: 1b621527d93a, settings revision: 9)
  -> or-agent blocked after 6 s: HTTP 0: URLError: <urlopen error [Errno 13] Permission denied>
  -> or-agent-2 blocked after 0 s: HTTP 0: URLError: <urlopen error [Errno 13] Permission denied>
[21:22:05] ok      #2: We're making great progress and on track to meet our goals!
[21:22:11] ok      #3: We're making great progress and everything is on track!

